/-! # TvLocalsSimplify: e-graph certificates for code with locals, checked by the kernel

Generated by `tools/wasm-egraph` (`wasm-egraph tv-seg`, Binaryen `--simplify-locals` on `locals40.wasm`);
do not edit. Each `BodyEquiv` theorem relates the two instruction lists themselves (equal
results, stores, modules and traps; locals may differ), checked by `decide +kernel` on
`checkBody` (`SegEquiv` and `checkSeg` for segment cases: the locals are equal too;
`BodyEquivSel`/`checkBodySel` for bodies with `select`; `FuncEquiv`/`checkFunc` for bodies whose
declared locals differ, compared from function entry); each `_everyRun` theorem restates it in
the every-run logic (`Silmaril.Wasm.Auto.Equiv.OutEquiv` or `SegEquiv`, or
`Silmaril.Wasm.Auto.ESeg.FuncOutEquiv`) for typed bodies, traps included (segments: typed
and trap-free). The search that found the certificates is not trusted.
-/

@[expose] public section

